      "created_at": "2012-04-05T05:08:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Rooftop Combat says “Deal the villain character card 10 or more damage in a single round to destroy this card.”  Is it 10 damage from any source?  Or only from heroes?  I realize that Rooftop Combat effectively neutralizes the environment, but we had a situation where Rooftop Combat came out with Channel the Eclipse, which makes Dawn deal herself 2 (3 with Rooftop Combat) damage at the end of the villain turn.  Does that 3 damage count toward the total of 10 for the round?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
