      "created_at": "2012-04-11T16:18:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Apologies for ambiguous wordings!  Yes, the 10 damage has to come from hero targets.  The phrase “deal the villain character card 10 or more damage…” has an implied “You (the heroes) must” at the start of it.  This will be fixed!</p>",
